OL,3,GNEWSAMum in hospice treated to brunch
OL,4,Asurprise from favourite cafe
OL,5,
OL,6,FCafe owner Mark Dempsey said he knew
OL,7,FJean well and she had been "a regular
OL,8,Fat our restaurant from the start, so I
OL,9,Fwas more than happy to bring her
OL,10,Ffavourite dish."
